# Cell profile: the UR20 test cell (ISO-80 flange, `ur20` bracket print, camera clocked 45 deg).
# Fill in UR_HOST with the controller's IP (Settings -> System -> Network on the pendant).
# Loaded by `--cell ur20` / `UR_CELL=ur20`; a variable already set in the shell wins.
UR_HOST=
UR_PLATFORM=polyscopex
UR_ROBOT_API_PORT=80
UR_PRIMARY_PORT=30001
UR_RTDE_PORT=30004
PERCEPTRONICS_BRACKET=ur20
UR_ROBOT_MODEL=UR20
# The tool is the robot's active TCP: set it on the pendant once the tool is known;
# the camera computer carries no tool length of its own.
